          ],
          "sectionId": 39913
        }
      ],
      "title": "真爱无坦途·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "39914001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "教你们唱的那首歌，练的怎么样了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "「酷炫的游戏团子，叛逆的打架团子。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "笨蛋，不要擅自修改歌词，跟我一起唱——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "「顽皮的烧烤团子，温柔的豆沙团子。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "好极了，待会见到渚，我们一起在她面前合唱这首歌，她一定会很开心的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "咦，渚去哪里了，怎么没见到人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "刚才还在这里，怎么转眼就看不到人了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "会不会去了阳台，我们到那边找找吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "主人家，阳台的一角。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "到处都找遍了，还是没见到渚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "这个地方对渚来说到处都很陌生……所以她会到哪里去呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "别担心，我们再到处找找。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "咦，那不是小杏吗？找到小杏，就一定能找到渚啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "我和渚没有在一起，我也在找她呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "怎么，你们也没看到她吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "我们把主人家到处都找了一遍，没有见到渚的影子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "奇怪，那她会去哪里呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "哇，就像整个人蒸发了一样，彻底消失得无影无踪，可能吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914019",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "糟了……渚不会遇到什么危险了吧……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39914020",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "渚……你究竟在哪里……别让我担心……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-978",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "clannad",
          "rowIds": [
            39914001,
