          ],
          "sectionId": 39914
        }
      ],
      "title": "真爱无坦途·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "39915001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "爱猫社区，半山街道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "太阳快下山了，还是没有找到渚……她会去哪里呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗……噗，噗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗……噗……噗噗噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "牡丹冲开人群，快速向远处跑去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "啊，牡丹这是怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "我从没见过牡丹这个样子，快，我们追上去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗——噗噗噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗噗噗噗噗噗——噗！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "牡丹，你给我停下！听到没有，我在命令你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "哈啊……哈啊……牡丹以前也跑得这么快吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "爱猫社区，美食街。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "嘿嘿~麻辣小龙虾，大烧鹅，五香猪蹄，可乐鸡翅……这些美食的制作方法都被星洛抄下来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "唔，不过还是没有那天在野外遇到的小猪猪闻起来香……真是可惜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "咿呀！这不是从星洛手底下溜走的美食小猪猪嘛！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "小猪猪，你好哇。好久不见，还记得星洛吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗？噗噗！噗噗噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39915019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "哇呀呀，你怎么又跑了呢，不可以哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-979",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "clannad",
          "rowIds": [
            39915001,
            39915002,
            39915003,
            39915004,
            39915005,
            39915006,
