            39915019
          ],
          "sectionId": 39915
        }
      ],
      "title": "真爱无坦途·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "39916001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "牡丹发了疯一样地四处冲撞——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗噗——噗噗噗噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗噗噗噗噗噗——噗！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "小猪猪，你不要乱跑啦！星洛不追你了好不好，快停下！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "咿呀！前面是河道，真的不能再往前跑了！小猪猪！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "我看到牡丹了，在那边！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "糟糕，它就要掉进河道里去了，坐稳了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "藤林杏骑着机车，加速冲到了牡丹的身边，成功将其救下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "成了！我们……居然在牡丹差一点掉进河道之前，成功地救下了牡丹！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "小意思，我对自己的车技一向很自信。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "如果不是我及时骑车赶到，牡丹就危险了……知道错了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗……噗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "藤林杏将牡丹抱到安全区域，大家总算松了口气。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "小猪猪，对不起哦，星洛不是故意的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "牡丹已经把事情的经过告诉我了，这次的事错不在你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "果然是牡丹的主人，居然可以听懂它的话。对了，它为什么会突然变得奇怪呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "我正想告诉你，牡丹是因为闻到了渚的味道，想第一时间找到渚，所以才会那么着急。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "什么？！渚在哪里，快带我们过去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39916020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-980",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
